3. The instructions contained in para 2 above shall supplement and be read in conjunction with the existing guidelines/directions issued by the Reserve Bank of India, as amended from time to time, including those tabulated in Annex.
4. Any violation in this regard by REs will be viewed seriously.
Applicability
5. This circular shall apply to the following REs:
All Commercial Banks (including Local Area Banks, Regional Rural Banks, and Small Finance Banks) excluding Payments Banks;
All All-India Financial Institutions (viz. Exim Bank, NABARD, NHB, SIDBI, and NaBFID);
All Non-Banking Financial Companies including Housing Finance Companies;
All Primary (Urban) Co-operative Banks, State Co-operative Banks, and District Central Co-operative Banks; and
All Asset Reconstruction Companies.
